{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Color Filter Array.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Color Filter Array.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"color filter array color filter array","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Color Filter Array.md","fileName":"Color Filter Array.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Color Filter Array","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-16 00:47\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Camera Sensor and Synthetic Image Forensics]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Camera Sensor and Synthetic Image Forensics","Demosaicing","fakephotos.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Color Filter Array.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Color Filter Array.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"color filter array color filter array","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Color Filter Array.md","fileName":"Color Filter Array.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Color Filter Array","heading":"Color Filter Array","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A color filter array is a repeating mosaic of red, green, and blue filters placed over a digital camera sensor. Each sensor element records only the light passed by its filter, so a raw capture initially contains one color measurement at each spatial location rather than a complete RGB pixel.\n\nThe camera reconstructs the two missing channels through [[Demosaicing]]. Because the filter pattern and interpolation are regular, they introduce local correlations that can serve as evidence of camera capture and can reveal regions whose pixels were later replaced.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Camera Sensor and Synthetic Image Forensics","Demosaicing","fakephotos.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Color Filter Array.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Color Filter Array.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"color filter array color filter array","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Color Filter Array.md","fileName":"Color Filter Array.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Color Filter Array","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[fakephotos.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Camera Sensor and Synthetic Image Forensics","Demosaicing","fakephotos.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}